{"item_uid": "學測83-social-026", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 27, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "上海港和天津港分別是我國中部地方和北部地方的最大商港，但都有其缺點，此二\n港的共同缺點是什麼？", "options": {"A": "冬季港面結冰", "B": "航道淤沙嚴重", "C": "港區潮差甚大", "D": "內陸運輸不便"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
