{"item_uid": "學測83-social-030", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 32, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "歐洲各地區中，在地形、氣候、海洋和港灣四方面皆最具優越性的是：", "options": {"A": "東歐", "B": "西歐", "C": "南歐", "D": "北歐\n-4-\n第 5 頁 社會考科\n共 13 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
{"item_uid": "學測83-social-031", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 83, "year_ce": 1994, "subject_key": "social", "subject_zh": "社會", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 33, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "非州的肯亞和薩伊都有赤道通過國境，年溫差都小，但前者氣溫涼爽宜人，而後者\n終年高溫，此種差異的主要影響因素是：", "options": {"A": "地勢的高低", "B": "湖泊的大小", "C": "洋流的性質", "D": "盛行風的向背"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf"}
